---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How TubWise handles affiliate links and product recommendations on gettubwise.com."
  path="/affiliate-disclosure"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Affiliate Disclosure' }]}
>
  <p>
    TubWise may earn a commission when you purchase products through links on this
    website. This comes at no additional cost to you.
  </p>

  <h2 id="how">How we choose products</h2>
  <p>
    When we recommend supplies or parts, we aim to prioritize compatibility, safety, and
    usefulness for homeowners. Commission rate is not the primary ranking factor.
  </p>

  <h2 id="labeling">How links are labeled</h2>
  <p>
    Affiliate relationships will be disclosed on pages that include partner links, and
    this disclosure page remains available from the site footer.
  </p>

  <h2 id="questions">Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Contact us via the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page if you have questions about a
    specific recommendation.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
